cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Africa Compute Tracker"
abstract: >-
  An open, version-controlled dataset of AI-relevant data centre infrastructure across Africa.
  Every substantive field carries a source, a trust tier, a retrieval date and a confidence
  level; contested assertions are recorded as claims rather than facts, and maintainer
  judgement is separated from sourced data.
type: dataset
